---
const { currentLocale } = Astro;
const basePath = currentLocale === 'el' ? '/el' : '';
---
<footer class="bg-surface-container border-t border-outline-variant/10 pt-24 pb-12">
<div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-24">
<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1">
<a href={basePath || '/'} class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-6 block">Xperia<span class="text-primary">.gr</span></a>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
Empowering the NEXT-GEN of creators and professionals through accessible, high-fidelity AI education in Greece.
</p>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 leading-none">Seminars</h4>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li><a href={`${basePath}/kids`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Kids AI</a></li>
<li><a href={`${basePath}/workshops`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Adult AI</a></li>
<li><a href={`${basePath}/workshops`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Business Professionals</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 leading-none">Resources</h4>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li><a href={`${basePath}/learn`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Learn Library</a></li>
<li><a href={`${basePath}/news`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">News Hub</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 leading-none">Connect</h4>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li><a href="mailto:hello@xperia.gr" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">hello@xperia.gr</a></li>
<li><a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">LinkedIn</a></li>
<li><a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Instagram</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant/10 gap-6">
<p class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant/60 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest leading-none">© {new Date().getFullYear()} XPERIA.GR — AI FOR ALL</p>
<div class="flex gap-8 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant/40 leading-none">
<a href="#" class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
<a href="#" class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</footer>
